<title>USA: TABLE- Alexander Haagen Q2 FFO shr drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Alexander Haagen Q2 FFO shr drops.</headline>
<dateline>MANHATTAN BEACH, Calif. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> FFO shr profit	   $0.32   profit	 $0.34</p>
<p> Shr     profit	    0.05   profit	  0.26</p>
